        <detaileddescription>
<para>Generate a random sample from the Matrix-T distribution.</para><para>Generate <computeroutput>N</computeroutput> independent draws from a <computeroutput>p x q</computeroutput> dimensional Matrix-T distribution. Each argument can be vectorized, meaning that it can have length either <computeroutput>N</computeroutput> or <computeroutput>1</computeroutput>, denoted here as <computeroutput>n</computeroutput>.</para><para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">N</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Integer number of random draws </para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">Lambda</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Matrix of <computeroutput>p x nq</computeroutput> mean matrices. </para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">SigmaR</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Matrix of <computeroutput>p x np</computeroutput> row-wise variance or precision matrices. </para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">SigmaC</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Matrix of <computeroutput>q x nq</computeroutput> column-wise variance matrices. </para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">nu</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Vector of <computeroutput>n</computeroutput> degrees-of-freedom parameters. </para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">inverse</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Boolean; <computeroutput>true/false</computeroutput> indicates that <computeroutput>SigmaR</computeroutput> is on the precision/variance scale. </para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Matrix of <computeroutput>p x Nq</computeroutput> random draws. </para></simplesect>
</para>        </detaileddescription>
